<%
  posts    = blog_posts
  featured = posts.select { |p| p[:featured] }.first(7)
  years_coding = Date.today.year - 2000
%>
<section class="hero">
  <img class="avatar" src="/img/tux1.jpeg" alt="Portrait of Sella Rafaeli" width="160" height="160">
  <div>
    <p class="kicker">Tel Aviv &middot; building for the web since 2000</p>
    <h1>Sella Rafaeli</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I build web applications end to end, and help other people build theirs.
      I run <a href="https://indydevs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">indydevs</a>, a network of very senior developers.
      American-Israeli tech entrepreneur, devout believer, amateur rock singer.
    </p>
    <p class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:sella.rafaeli@gmail.com">Say hello</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://linkedin.com/in/sella-rafaeli" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/SellaRafaeli" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BjCh9nQDAibvDXBWxOYrAsRDsT6JfKbpW_nW2Ezl4Hc/export?format=pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Résumé</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<ul class="stats">
  <li><b><%= years_coding %></b><span>years writing code</span></li>
  <li><b>~70</b><span>orgs I built software for</span></li>
  <li><b>5</b><span>years in Unit 8200</span></li>
  <li><b>30+</b><span>countries visited</span></li>
</ul>

<section class="block">
  <h2 class="section-label">Background</h2>
  <ul class="timeline">
    <li><span class="when">2022&ndash;</span><div><b>Founder, <a href="https://indydevs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">indydevs</a></b>. A network of very senior, independent developers.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">2016</span><div><b>Dev shop founder</b>. Built complex web apps for about 70 organizations.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">Startup</span><div><b>CTO &amp; co-founder</b> of <a href="https://medium.com/@sellarafaeli/yes-no-architecture-of-a-social-network-startup-in-2016-d6d2989ca1b3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">yes.no</a>, a Q&amp;A social network.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">Industry</span><div><b>Many dev roles</b> at orgs of every size, in San Francisco and Tel Aviv, Fiverr among them.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">Degree</span><div><b>BSc Computer Science &amp; Psychology</b>, Hebrew University, <i>magna cum laude</i>.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">Army</span><div><b>Intelligence Officer</b>, five years in Israel's SIGINT unit, 8200.</div></li>
    <li><span class="when">Travel</span><div><b>A year backpacking</b> South America, and <a href="/about">a lot of other adventures</a>.</div></li>
  </ul>
  <p class="aside">Fond of vanilla JS, Ruby (Sinatra) and MongoDB. Building complex web apps single-handedly has been the thread through all of it.</p>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 class="section-label">Selected writing</h2>
    <a href="/blog">All <%= posts.size %> posts &rarr;</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="postlist">
  <% featured.each do |p| %>
    <li>
      <a href="<%= p[:href] %>"<%= " target=_blank rel=noopener" if p[:external] %>>
        <time datetime="<%= p[:date].iso8601 %>"><%= p[:date].year %></time>
        <span class="t"><%= p[:title] %></span>
        <% if p[:external] %><span class="src"><%= p[:source] %> &#8599;</span><% end %>
      </a>
    </li>
  <% end %>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="block">
  <h2 class="section-label">Also here</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <a class="card" href="/articles"><b>Essays</b><span>Philosophy, belief, happiness, and letting go.</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/books"><b>Books</b><span>A spiritual guide, a paper on the limits of understanding, and a linear algebra textbook.</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/about"><b>About</b><span>Hitchhiking Tierra del Fuego, ice-climbing in Bolivia, and the Egyptian Ratscrew title.</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/contact"><b>Contact</b><span>Email, LinkedIn, GitHub. Don't be shy.</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
